  "description": "No 9  Durabhan is a super two-bedroom ground floor apartment, in a mature & small development on the eastern side of Galway City.\n\nExtending to approximately 640 sq. ft., the accommodation is enhanced by high ceilings in some rooms and comprises a porch leading to a light filled living/dining area with tiled flooring . The kitchen area, includes ample storage. A hallway leads to two bedroom and principal bathroom completes the accommodation.\n\nThe rear garden area, while communal, is easily assessed and enjoys a desirable west south westerly aspect.\n\nDurabhan is a well-regarded and meticulously maintained development, ideally located close to The Galway Clinic, Merlin Park Hospital, Briarhill Shopping Centre, and the Parkmore and Ballybrit Business Parks. The M6 Galway–Dublin Motorway is easily accessible, while Oranmore village is just a short drive away. Local amenities include a nearby shop, a large park, and Castlegar GAA Club – all within minutes` walk. The development itself is thoughtfully designed, with generous green spaces and well-kept landscaping.\n\nNumber 9 Durabhan presents an excellent opportunity to acquire an own door apartment in this well regarded location \nViewing is highly recommended.",
